COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.source_documents.extraction_version IS 'Extractor version that produced the text.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.source_documents.rights IS 'Usage rights or licence noted at fetch time.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.source_documents.valid_from IS 'When the content was true in the world.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.source_documents.valid_to IS 'When it stopped being true.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.source_documents.supersedes_id IS 'The row this one corrects or replaces.';
COMMENT ON TABLE hai.test_outcomes IS 'A point-in-time test of a control. A failed test is kept and shown, never dropped.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.test_outcomes.control_id IS 'Tested control.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.test_outcomes.protocol IS 'Test protocol.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.test_outcomes.method IS 'How the control was tested, from document review to independent audit. Only methods that exercise the control count as exercising a capability.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.test_outcomes.capabilities_exercised IS 'Which control capabilities the test actually operated (focus area control_verification).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.test_outcomes.threats_exercised IS 'Which containment threats the test attempted (focus area containment_security).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.test_outcomes.performed_at IS 'When the test ran.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.test_outcomes.result IS 'Pass, fail or inconclusive.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.test_outcomes.measured_value IS 'Measured value, if any.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.test_outcomes.assessor_org_id IS 'Who performed the test.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.test_outcomes.verifier_org_id IS 'Independent verifier, if any.';
COMMENT ON TABLE hai.claims IS 'An assertion the organization makes about itself. A claim is never evidence of its own truth. Uploads enter as claims.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.claims.claimant_org_id IS 'The organization making the claim.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.claims.assertion_text IS 'What is asserted.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.claims.scope_type IS 'What the claim is about.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.claims.scope_id IS 'Id of the control, incident or system the claim is about.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.claims.claimed_at IS 'When the claim was made.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.claims.source_document_id IS 'The uploaded or fetched document carrying the claim.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.claims.verified_by_org_id IS 'Independent verifier, when one exists.';
COMMENT ON TABLE hai.evidence_spans IS 'The citable unit. The exact quote with character offsets into the stored text (IC-03).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_spans.source_document_id IS 'Document the span is cut from.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_spans.char_start IS 'Start offset in the stored text.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_spans.char_end IS 'End offset (exclusive).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_spans.quote IS 'Exact text at the offsets.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_spans.extracted_assertion IS 'Short neutral paraphrase of what the quote says.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_spans.asserted_dates IS 'Dates mentioned in the quote.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_spans.section_heading IS 'Nearest heading above the span.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_spans.supersedes_id IS 'The row this one corrects or replaces.';
COMMENT ON TABLE hai.impact_measures IS 'A measured effect of the organization''s AI on people (focus area human_benefit). Separates what is intended from what is counted, what is measured in people''s lives and what an independent party evaluated. Evidence links may target it.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.impact_measures.org_id IS 'The organization whose AI produced the effect.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.impact_measures.ai_system_id IS 'The system, when identifiable.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.impact_measures.kind IS 'Stated intention, output metric, outcome metric or independently evaluated.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.impact_measures.outcome IS 'The human outcome claimed or measured, in plain words.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.impact_measures.metric IS 'What was measured and how.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.impact_measures.unit IS 'Unit of the values.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.impact_measures.baseline_value IS 'Value before the AI application, when known.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.impact_measures.measured_value IS 'Value measured.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.impact_measures.population IS 'Who was affected and how many.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.impact_measures.measured_at IS 'When the measurement was taken.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.impact_measures.period_months IS 'Length of the measurement period; durability needs more than one period.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.impact_measures.measured_by_org_id IS 'Who took the measurement.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.impact_measures.verifier_org_id IS 'Independent verifier, if any. Required for independently_evaluated.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.impact_measures.source_document_id IS 'The document reporting the measure.';
COMMENT ON TABLE hai.evidence_links IS 'The only bridge from evidence to a score. One span, one target, one criterion, six separate judgments (spec section 6).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_links.span_id IS 'The quoted span.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_links.target_type IS 'Kind of thing the span is about.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_links.target_id IS 'Id of the organization, system, claim, control, test outcome, incident or impact measure.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_links.criterion_code IS 'The one criterion this link bears on (IC-08).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_links.polarity IS 'Support, contradict or neutral. Never updated (IC-01).';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_links.admissibility IS 'Usable in scoring at all. Changed only via review.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_links.admissibility_reason IS 'Why the link is inadmissible or pending.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_links.maturity_rung IS 'How far up the ladder the quote proves. Set by the classifier from the quote.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_links.execution_level IS 'Per-span proof of execution.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_links.evidence_class IS 'Foundational, core governance, operational or external validation.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_links.independence IS 'Who stands behind the statement. Recomputed from relations.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_links.source_tier IS 'Potential authority of the publisher type. Never sets maturity.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_links.focus_area IS 'The one focus area the quote speaks to, when it does. Reporting only; never changes a weight.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_links.proposer IS 'Who proposed the link, heuristic or provider:model.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_links.relevance IS 'Proposer''s relevance estimate.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_links.valid_from IS 'When the evidence was true.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_links.valid_to IS 'When it stopped being true.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_links.reviewer_id IS 'Reviewer who last changed admissibility.';
COMMENT ON COLUMN hai.evidence_links.supersedes_id IS 'The row this one corrects or replaces.';
